{"page":116,"width":1892,"height":2553,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"4.5 스택의 응용: 후위 표기 수식의 계산","words":[{"text":"4.5","x":387,"y":213,"width":64,"height":50},{"text":"스택의","x":466,"y":211,"width":148,"height":54},{"text":"응용:","x":633,"y":211,"width":111,"height":55},{"text":"후위","x":762,"y":211,"width":97,"height":54},{"text":"표기","x":877,"y":210,"width":96,"height":55},{"text":"수식의","x":992,"y":210,"width":148,"height":55},{"text":"계산","x":1160,"y":210,"width":102,"height":54}]},{"text":"우리는 컴퓨터 프로그램에서 많은 수식을 만난다. 예를 들어서 다음과 같은 복잡한 수식도 자주","words":[{"text":"우리는","x":387,"y":360,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":498,"y":361,"width":89,"height":34},{"text":"프로그램에서","x":603,"y":360,"width":184,"height":34},{"text":"많은","x":803,"y":360,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"수식을","x":878,"y":360,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"만난다.","x":985,"y":359,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"예를","x":1104,"y":359,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"들어서","x":1179,"y":358,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"다음과","x":1291,"y":358,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"같은","x":1403,"y":357,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"복잡한","x":1482,"y":358,"width":104,"height":34},{"text":"수식도","x":1598,"y":357,"width":101,"height":35},{"text":"자주","x":1713,"y":360,"width":62,"height":35}]},{"text":"만나게 된다.","words":[{"text":"만나게","x":389,"y":418,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"된다.","x":496,"y":418,"width":69,"height":35}]},{"text":"수식은 연산자와 피연산자, 괄호로 이루어져 있다. 연산자들은 우선순위가 있어서 우선순위가","words":[{"text":"수식은","x":424,"y":648,"width":97,"height":32},{"text":"연산자와","x":534,"y":648,"width":124,"height":33},{"text":"피연산자,","x":669,"y":648,"width":131,"height":34},{"text":"괄호로","x":814,"y":647,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"이루어져","x":922,"y":646,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"있다.","x":1060,"y":646,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"연산자들은","x":1147,"y":647,"width":160,"height":33},{"text":"우선순위가","x":1319,"y":646,"width":167,"height":35},{"text":"있어서","x":1499,"y":647,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"우선순위가","x":1610,"y":647,"width":165,"height":36}]},{"text":"높은 연산자가 먼저 계산된다. 위의 수식에서는 괄호가 가장 우선순위가 높기 때문에 괄호 안이","words":[{"text":"높은","x":387,"y":705,"width":66,"height":31},{"text":"연산자가","x":467,"y":704,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"먼저","x":605,"y":705,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"계산된다.","x":680,"y":704,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"위의","x":827,"y":704,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"수식에서는","x":901,"y":704,"width":158,"height":34},{"text":"괄호가","x":1071,"y":704,"width":97,"height":33},{"text":"가장","x":1181,"y":704,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"우선순위가","x":1257,"y":704,"width":167,"height":34},{"text":"높기","x":1435,"y":704,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"때문에","x":1518,"y":705,"width":97,"height":33},{"text":"괄호","x":1630,"y":704,"width":67,"height":33},{"text":"안이","x":1712,"y":705,"width":58,"height":34}]},{"text":"가장 먼저 계산되고 이어서 곱셈, 나눗셈. 덧셈, 뺄셈 순으로 계산된다. 컴파일러는 어떤 도구를","words":[{"text":"가장","x":389,"y":761,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"먼저","x":466,"y":761,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"계산되고","x":541,"y":761,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"이어서","x":679,"y":761,"width":88,"height":34},{"text":"곱셈,","x":782,"y":760,"width":70,"height":35},{"text":"나눗셈.","x":869,"y":761,"width":101,"height":34},{"text":"덧셈,","x":987,"y":761,"width":69,"height":35},{"text":"뺄셈","x":1074,"y":760,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"순으로","x":1148,"y":761,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"계산된다.","x":1261,"y":761,"width":137,"height":33},{"text":"컴파일러는","x":1418,"y":762,"width":166,"height":33},{"text":"어떤","x":1598,"y":761,"width":64,"height":33},{"text":"도구를","x":1678,"y":764,"width":96,"height":31}]},{"text":"八卜\u0026하여 수식을 계산하는 것일까? 수식은 스택을 시용하여 계산된다.","words":[{"text":"八卜\u0026하여","x":388,"y":818,"width":123,"height":35},{"text":"수식을","x":526,"y":819,"width":95,"height":33},{"text":"계산하는","x":633,"y":818,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"것일까?","x":768,"y":818,"width":110,"height":34},{"text":"수식은","x":888,"y":818,"width":96,"height":34},{"text":"스택을","x":993,"y":818,"width":97,"height":33},{"text":"시용하여","x":1100,"y":817,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"계산된다.","x":1241,"y":818,"width":138,"height":34}]},{"text":"수식을 표기히는 방법에는 중위(mfix), 후위(postfix), 전위(prefix)의 3가지 방법이 있다. 연","words":[{"text":"수식을","x":424,"y":875,"width":96,"height":33},{"text":"표기히는","x":533,"y":875,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"방법에는","x":673,"y":875,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"중위(mfix),","x":809,"y":874,"width":161,"height":36},{"text":"후위(postfix),","x":987,"y":874,"width":198,"height":36},{"text":"전위(prefix)의","x":1206,"y":875,"width":209,"height":36},{"text":"3가지","x":1434,"y":875,"width":81,"height":35},{"text":"방법이","x":1534,"y":875,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"있다.","x":1652,"y":874,"width":71,"height":34},{"text":"연","x":1744,"y":876,"width":28,"height":32}]},{"text":"산자가 피연산자 사이에 있으면 중위이고 연산자가 피연산자 뒤에 있으면 후위이다. 연산자가","words":[{"text":"산자가","x":388,"y":932,"width":96,"height":33},{"text":"피연산자","x":500,"y":932,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"사이에","x":640,"y":933,"width":90,"height":33},{"text":"있으면","x":749,"y":932,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"중위이고","x":854,"y":931,"width":125,"height":35},{"text":"연산자가","x":997,"y":931,"width":126,"height":35},{"text":"피연산자","x":1139,"y":932,"width":129,"height":34},{"text":"뒤에","x":1283,"y":932,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"있으면","x":1366,"y":932,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"후위이다.","x":1480,"y":932,"width":142,"height":35},{"text":"연산자가","x":1645,"y":931,"width":130,"height":35}]},{"text":"피연산자 앞에 있으면 전위라고 한다. 인간은 주로 중위표기법을 시용하지만 컴파일러는 주로","words":[{"text":"피연산자","x":390,"y":989,"width":126,"height":33},{"text":"앞에","x":531,"y":989,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"있으면","x":610,"y":990,"width":91,"height":32},{"text":"전위라고","x":718,"y":989,"width":122,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":854,"y":989,"width":70,"height":33},{"text":"인간은","x":945,"y":989,"width":94,"height":32},{"text":"주로","x":1052,"y":990,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"중위표기법을","x":1131,"y":990,"width":197,"height":33},{"text":"시용하지만","