xt":"표기","x":1479,"y":1617,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"방식에서는","x":1560,"y":1616,"width":170,"height":33},{"text":"괄","x":1743,"y":1617,"width":33,"height":32}]},{"text":"호가 필요 없다. 즉 중위 표기 수식 (1+2)*7의 경우 괄호는 더하기 연산이 곱하기 연산보다 먼저","words":[{"text":"호가","x":394,"y":1672,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"필요","x":468,"y":1673,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"없다.","x":542,"y":1673,"width":66,"height":34},{"text":"즉","x":622,"y":1676,"width":33,"height":31},{"text":"중위","x":665,"y":1674,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"표기","x":739,"y":1674,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"수식","x":812,"y":1675,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"(1+2)*7의","x":887,"y":1674,"width":142,"height":34},{"text":"경우","x":1046,"y":1675,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"괄호는","x":1120,"y":1675,"width":98,"height":32},{"text":"더하기","x":1230,"y":1674,"width":92,"height":34},{"text":"연산이","x":1341,"y":1674,"width":93,"height":32},{"text":"곱하기","x":1449,"y":1673,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"연산보다","x":1565,"y":1673,"width":133,"height":33},{"text":"먼저","x":1712,"y":1673,"width":60,"height":33}]},{"text":"수행되어야 함을 나타낸다. 똑같은 식을 후위 표기 방법으로 나타내면 12+7*가 되어 괄호를 쓰","words":[{"text":"수행되어야","x":394,"y":1729,"width":155,"height":34},{"text":"함을","x":560,"y":1729,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"나타낸다.","x":635,"y":1730,"width":130,"height":34},{"text":"똑같은","x":781,"y":1731,"width":95,"height":32},{"text":"식을","x":888,"y":1731,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"후위","x":962,"y":1731,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"표기","x":1040,"y":1731,"width":59,"height":33},{"text":"방법으로","x":1117,"y":1731,"width":129,"height":33},{"text":"나타내면","x":1260,"y":1730,"width":130,"height":34},{"text":"12+7*가","x":1403,"y":1729,"width":133,"height":34},{"text":"되어","x":1549,"y":1729,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"괄호를","x":1627,"y":1729,"width":104,"height":32},{"text":"쓰","x":1744,"y":1732,"width":32,"height":25}]},{"text":"지 않고서도 우선 계산하여야 할 내용을 나타낼 수 있다. 또 연산자의 우선순위도 생각할 필요가","words":[{"text":"지","x":397,"y":1785,"width":25,"height"